Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.84,0:00:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)跟我决斗 你敢接吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 引导之刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)希望剑 双重闪光斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的决斗现在才刚刚开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 使出全力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到倒下为止尽情享受吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救我们时留下的伤！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一两个伤 根本不算什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特…… 你竟然为了跟我的决斗到这种地步……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体：他超越了疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.15,0:00:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至连那都想要享受……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份心情 游马也……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 连我这副身体也……》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 这片场地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我产生了某种影响……》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:00:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)两个人 都好强的气势。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)啊啊 那些家伙是认真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马… 小心点。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤燃烧拳击手·开关击手！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:02:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击·灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是 将卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最上方的卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那张卡是燃烧拳击手的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.03,0:03:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡以外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的燃烧拳击手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手·反击拳手！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将这张卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将燃烧拳击手·护头拳手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 发动开关击球手的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 在作为超量召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}素材时 会变成2只份！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识 认真的我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刻进眼里吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手·开关击球手 2只份和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手·护头拳手 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.105！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有斗)燃烧拳击手 流星之拳套！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.105！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超百 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 有斗的王牌怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 流星之拳套攻击希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！霍普的攻击力是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借燃烧的斗志
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明有5000…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 我该上的时候 就会上的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～ 星尘冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽一定有什么蹊跷。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用一个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效那只怪兽的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突破它！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动星尘的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星尘在攻击力比对方怪兽低的情况下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次战斗不会被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这次战斗不会被无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我受到的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为代价 由你来承受！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普和赛斯塔斯的攻击力差是2500！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份伤害 要由我来吃！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有栖)再吃一击 星光冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 我盖下一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一击就让生命值降到500了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去可不妙啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 我们这场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愉快的决斗 就这么结束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还早着呢 我要玩得更尽兴。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:06:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我们的生命值只剩500了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是我还是阿斯特拉尔这都是绝对不能输的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但即便如此 我也要把这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.38,0:06:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成一场特别的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们至今为止和各种家伙战斗过。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了收集 No.卡为了不被夺走{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼了命地战斗过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 和那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和阿里特战斗的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就莫名其妙地整个人都热血起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来我 是无法将你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.55,0:06:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那燃烧的意志 消除掉的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 我也只能上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.08,0:06:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！这次就让你见识一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的全力模式！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊！ 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:06:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:06:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当遥远的两个灵魂交汇之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传承之力将会显现。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光 这就是你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全力模式吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太帅了！ 帅爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)这就是泽阿尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵 看来那些家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放弃啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 游马和星光
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能放弃{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不会！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量宝藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:08:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}这样{\fnYusei Magic}一来 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}场{\fnYusei Magic}上的怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}・超量\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只 就能抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 场上的怪兽有2只。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 我抽2张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 希望皇 霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)混沌超量 变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo. 39！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)将混沌化为光的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.19,0:08:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这样不是不利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力从5000降到2500减少了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 这样正好。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}流星之塞斯塔斯的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高于
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的时候才会发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，星辉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿出我们全部的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！让我来尝尝！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧～希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击流星之塞斯塔斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲上去！流星之塞斯塔斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是这样下去会同归于尽！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑！混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而 就在这一瞬间 速攻魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动额外标准！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们场上的怪兽·额外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有1只被战斗破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.47,0:09:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效怪兽效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.35,0:09:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 霍普雷复活了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要埋葬流星的星尘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能拼上性命去挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们的力量！ 泽阿尔的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真高兴啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.55,0:10:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我也得让你见识见识在那之上的底力才行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.61,0:10:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人的场上出现了流星的星尘！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也发动了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量立起啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.83,0:10:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我们一样的卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过超量立起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这回合不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放2张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)阿里特 你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能感受到你们的全力。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我所追求的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这样的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会把我所有的思念化为力量全部砸向你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 阿里特！我也要在这场决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切都砸向你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要暴露出我的一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看吧 我的真身。我的真正心意！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特。你竟然 到了这种地步……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 阿里特的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马/星光体)真身。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 那家伙真正的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那就是阿里特……。但 阿里特就是阿里特》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这下就全部凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.78,0:12:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好戏现在才要开始呢。 来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.80,0:12:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡 异热同心宝藏。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上每有1只怪兽·异热同心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽有2只。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.63,0:12:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 我抽2张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 升阶？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是想让号数
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:13:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己的怪兽·异热同心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌·异热同心。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的流星之塞斯塔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吞噬黑暗的混沌。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以光贯穿吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.105。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手 彗星之凯撒斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这就是我的全部心意！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彗星之凯撒斯的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个混沌叠放单位取除
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.87,0:14:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.43,0:14:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这招一旦成立游马就完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 超量训练！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 我的1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把彗星凯斯特的效果弹开了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，攻击我还是要照打的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.31,0:14:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用彗星凯斯特攻击希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彗星喷射！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.81,0:15:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实伤害是吃到了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但霍普雷并没有被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不愧是你啊 游马 星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我丢弃一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然挡下了彗星凯斯特的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思 太有意思了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是太有意思了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.41,0:15:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不够 游马 星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.69,0:15:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你们更多的全力全都砸到我身上来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！ 明明是这么热血的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是用屏障，而我们……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来享受决斗吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的决斗就热血地享受到最后最后一刻吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回应他的心意吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到最后。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！我也要 这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彻底享受个痛快！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)把所有的思念……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都赌在这抽卡上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗 一切都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽到的卡 也是由决斗者创造的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马/阿斯特拉尔)闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！我要 召唤这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翱翔天际的空之王者用你的爪牙掌握万物吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 兽王·威猛鹰！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当这家伙的对手生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比我们高出2000点以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无需解放即可召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兽王·威猛鹰！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.79,0:16:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 当我们的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存在希望皇 霍普雷时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:16:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}威猛鹰会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为霍普雷的装备卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.07,0:17:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其攻击力上升2000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猛鹰充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)攻击卡艾斯托斯！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.86,0:17:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动墓地中反击爆破的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.03,0:17:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这只怪兽从墓地除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手墓地中的陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动的卡是这张！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗·突袭！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？从对手墓地发动陷阱？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，这场战斗，我场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有1只不会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，我受到的战斗伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个数值的伤害给予对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.56,0:17:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鹰身女妖的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗时，仅限一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:17:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以无效对手的陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个我也早就读到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是最后一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 鸡冠花·十字！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中当对手的卡牌效果发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个效果无效
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手造成500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？竟然对仪准克罗发动反击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.86,0:18:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就拿下了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把所有的力量都释放出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 最后机会 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对手的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动1张反击陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？你也要从墓地！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)发动反击反击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将在战斗中发动的反击陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效并破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 这场战斗中受到的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为2倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.21,0:18:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 热血沸腾啊 我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鹰身女妖计数器·玛格纳姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 混沌·鹰身女妖·斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 阿里特！阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没事吧！？喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.09,0:20:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真开心啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我也是！下次再打吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特… 你 难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿去吧 我的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收不了 No.卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是来接我了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！？星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 你怎么了！？星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 基拉古 是你干的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多管闲事的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.23,0:21:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.57,0:21:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 阿斯特拉尔！ 阿斯特拉尔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 阿里特！ 阿里特…… 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被干掉了……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 被…… 被谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真…… 月……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.85,0:22:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 撑住！ 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！ 阿里特！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
